2630	+// probeRepoMirrored checks whether owner/repo has a mirror on the active
2631	+// context's core or the default cluster's core, consulting a short-TTL
2632	+// per-user cache first so hot paths (`entire status`) don't pay a network
2633	+// round-trip on every run. Failures are cached briefly too, so an offline
2634	+// terminal doesn't hang on every invocation. Owner/repo arrive lowercased
2635	+// from the mirror rung.
